### SmartLift API examples
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api

### Create lift
POST {{baseUrl}}/lifts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serialNumber": "SL-2026-0001",
  "model": "OTIS-GEN2",
  "manufacturer": "Otis",
  "status": "CREATED",
  "manufacturerOrganizationId": 1,
  "serviceOrganizationId": 2,
  "managementOrganizationId": 3
}

### Get all lifts
GET {{baseUrl}}/lifts

### Get lift by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/lifts/1

### Update lift
PUT {{baseUrl}}/lifts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serialNumber": "SL-2026-0001",
  "model": "OTIS-GEN2-REV-B",
  "manufacturer": "Otis",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "manufacturerOrganizationId": 1,
  "serviceOrganizationId": 2,
  "managementOrganizationId": 3
}

### Delete lift
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/lifts/1

### Create lift event
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "liftId": 1,
  "type": "FAULT",
  "eventAt": "2026-03-19T10:30:00",
  "description": "Door sensor fault detected during morning inspection.",
  "performedByUserId": 5
}

### Get all events
GET {{baseUrl}}/events

### Get events for one lift timeline
GET {{baseUrl}}/events?liftId=1

### Get event by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/1

### Update event
PUT {{baseUrl}}/events/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "liftId": 1,
  "type": "REPAIR",
  "eventAt": "2026-03-19T12:00:00",
  "description": "Door sensor replaced and calibration completed.",
  "performedByUserId": 5
}

### Delete event
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/events/1
